Subject: [PATCH] event logs: default to newest first with current table API

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD Web UI policy]

Use bootstrap-vue-next sort descriptors instead of ignored legacy sort-desc
and string keys. Default to Created descending, with numeric entry ID as an
equal-second tie-breaker. Pre-order mapped rows without mutating Vuex data.
Bind the sort model so polling/deletion refresh preserves the user's sort.

